## What this project is

Single-file visual Python builder (`index.html`) + optional Electron shell + static landing. No React/webpack for the core app. Blockly + Pyodide + localStorage.

## Before you ship any change

Run Section **0** of SOUL (15-point pre-delivery checklist), then:

```bash
npm test
# or: cd tests && npm test
# headless only (no Chromium):     SKIP_BROWSER=1
# UI load only (no Pyodide download): SKIP_PYODIDE=1
# refresh example fixtures:         UPDATE_FIXTURES=1
```

Expect **0 failures**. First full run may download Pyodide (~7MB) and take 1–3 minutes.

