## Delivery packaging (SOUL §29)

Every handoff to the human director should include: what/why, file list, how to verify (`npm test` + open `index.html`), risks, and suggested commit message(s). No stubs, no “polish later.”

Canonical latest handoff: **[MANIFEST.md](MANIFEST.md)** (must match current product version).
